  "question": {
    "text": "A thermodynamic cycle <math><mi>x</mi><mi>y</mi><mi>z</mi><mi>x</mi></math> is shown on a <math><mi>V</mi></math> - <math><mi>T</mi></math> diagram.<br /><img src=\"assets\\qt0137_13638770c4af.png\" style=\"width: 197px; height: 191px;\" /><br />The <math><mi>P</mi></math> - <math><mi>V</mi></math> diagram that best describes this cycle is: (Diagrams are schematic and not to scale)"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<img src=\"assets\\ot1_0137_92b68ff5ff76.png\" style=\"width: 195px; height: 182px;\" />",
